#: scenario2:scenario2_2969C666_724A_4A50_88D6_FC4F569A6141
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4cffa8f42c537c956ae0f17ac775f7dab0adaf3a4871686f40d8ea680504e891
#. default-sha256: c9ea0133b5dd30b85f4c2b0bebe141458b1b78e9c5a8fe7bd09a31b1551c3e1e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2969C666_724A_4A50_88D6_FC4F569A6141"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫The mansion sat near "
"the ocean."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫屋敷は海の近くにございました。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_25E93473_3C7F_47AF_B45C_9D323A6F3D5A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9f9aae4bf359697bd1aa3f397489731260a198cd893a783be9cd8a8b2c05e8a1
#. default-sha256: 7a2d4b52554d462f50d3fd4ac1f847b9014276b53d2ea82c54c4f84861d9b0c5
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_25E93473_3C7F_47AF_B45C_9D323A6F3D5A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫To say it was perched upon a cliff might make it sound rather intimidating..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t⟪k:1⟫断崖に鎮座する屋敷と言えば何とも恐ろしそうな印象ですが、"
"⟪k:2⟫それこそ窓辺から見下ろす晴天の海は、"

#: scenario2:scenario2_685FCB43_1481_45D7_BBBE_8FB9C1AC2175
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e7b38136db6b084cca0faf6312438865e4b5849bace66c30ac9e1a342660a1a3
#. default-sha256: cddfc3b302848a65679e2afcec1ad4100316a6e2201720bb10123c9d265de39b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_685FCB43_1481_45D7_BBBE_8FB9C1AC2175"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but you could see the beautifully clear sea through the windows—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a glittering "
"expanse of emerald and turquoise."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫エメラルドとターコイズが散りばめられたように美しいものでした。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_A319AAD1_7EC5_4829_AA77_42149F2755E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 38dbb53d059a24afc05fda7764f8f461706a80813a1ff476b3111e034a966093
#. default-sha256: 10006949f527ef07eb2fa5388cbf5b7d92eaf3148e36f1a1be60b8db6dfa2638
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A319AAD1_7EC5_4829_AA77_42149F2755E7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫If the mansion had been in proper condition, it would have been breathtaking against "
"that backdrop."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫もしも屋敷に手入れが行き届いていたのなら、⟪k:2⟫背景と相まって見る者全てが溜息をもらした"
"ことでしょう。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_0159B64C_5EDC_4035_9E3A_A504D7D567BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2708372403119ee47fee85d7d01f9afaf3e915aa2ebf9654b65ae2dc5a870421
#. default-sha256: 57c5567c1eb3c8b68a25bc6aff5a89f569f234a1d51b73b49d2e166ebd381997
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0159B64C_5EDC_4035_9E3A_A504D7D567BF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I even wanted to plant orange trees in the garden."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫わたくし、⟪k:1⟫庭にオレンジの木を植えたかったほどですもの。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_C0EFF7A2_48B2_4EB6_AF03_BD062798B84A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 227fe0ded62452787c1197f91fda24facf193f9a9774bc553725390c20df9ee1
#. default-sha256: 0fcaa048a0e40077003f6016b535982b4040a549decd19d652c0abb1d53cc42f
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C0EFF7A2_48B2_4EB6_AF03_BD062798B84A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though it was a tumultuous era, the sun still shone bright upon the land, which only served "
"to emphasize the house’s unsightliness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫動乱の時代とはいえ、⟪k:1⟫大地に照りつける太陽は明るく、⟪k:2⟫だからこそ余計に屋敷は惨めでござ"
"いました。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_F40581AD_5819_4290_BCF0_FDEF7F40476F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 43a7aa76ec42393c5624256c2470366062f9ec59d17d893e4803310418dd9c29
#. default-sha256: 0d5785f958136e6533310abdcf3acf5bfa3d8896d045154a3d7eaf1f7563f9f1
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_F40581AD_5819_4290_BCF0_FDEF7F40476F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oh yes, perhaps I should give you some more background information. ⟪k:1⟫At that period in "
"time, a war had just drawn to a close."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫動乱……、⟪k:1⟫そうですわ、⟪k:2⟫ご説明が足りませんでした。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫その時代は、⟪k:5⟫丁度ひとつ"
"の戦が終わったばかりだったのです。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_B6FE0EFE_F238_4376_A78D_6B7BADCD9866
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aa6979002f8a2cb0abd1a56e5140020be56d686f7e434b382acbb4e862c99163
#. default-sha256: d04aa3ee901e4e6fcefc9d1412e6d42cda3140eb50f2e42fc12347fbb0ecb5cd
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B6FE0EFE_F238_4376_A78D_6B7BADCD9866"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The once gorgeous wetlands were infested with crows picking at decaying "
"remains. Bodies of soldiers fallen in battle continually washed up on the shores of coastal "
"villages."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t本来美しいはずのその地方の湿地にも、⟪k:5⟫"
"死骸を啄んだ黒烏が降り立ち、⟪k:6⟫海辺の町ではひっきりなしに戦で朽ちはてた亡骸が押し寄せ――"

#: scenario2:scenario2_7B0AC144_0BB9_4AFB_97DD_31740DBF1CB0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: afed05584451f0f3399a265ec4a79e078ef51f1e130b554ce05d85ffcc783e90
#. default-sha256: bf5c159ba6232cb98311306c1640155be724073c046cd6ff87c6b0d663834b5a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7B0AC144_0BB9_4AFB_97DD_31740DBF1CB0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The people wanted nothing more than for the curtain to draw on that deeply political contest."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t彼らは政略に満ちた戦争の終焉を待ち望んでいました。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_B8D6AF17_A0A1_476A_9A57_430A2AB83B0A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9bbc72b51c4bd3f21cb738dda6fbec2e2a04fb05dc9aef2523d5da86f7a3c032
#. default-sha256: 2cfcdb8b4a6320e087811eedc5916582b44373b7eca47e037a1b6385447f15ad
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B8D6AF17_A0A1_476A_9A57_430A2AB83B0A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And when it finally did, the kingdom, with its richly fertile shores, was stripped of its "
"independence, beginning a new era under new rule."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t結果、⟪k:1⟫海辺の肥沃な王国は、⟪k:2⟫自治を剥奪される形で新た"
"な幕開けを迎えましたわ。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_A9FF47C2_8D32_4008_AB0B_61249DC285D0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 817b6c10177f9b1ffa0324c9e11475c2a6febacd26a74406ae0a1c00d73cd3ba
#. default-sha256: af3d99a3378ca709f3fdbc19a9f9eb6f6ab6537f2f498fc83921e6fe011e3050
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A9FF47C2_8D32_4008_AB0B_61249DC285D0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The people were exhausted, their spirits wasted away."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t人々は疲弊し、⟪k:1⟫荒んでおりました。\t"

#: scenario2:scenario2_C7EED3DA_F03C_489C_9F20_EE195A4DDC86
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 63ff45328e0128711263e72b44fd2ed6cb87262e6453a8581dee60db324b9cd7
#. default-sha256: b634977a92bbc302a199f06e90cd5a5efe60df21f450f16f7732f90583229561
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C7EED3DA_F03C_489C_9F20_EE195A4DDC86"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And the splendor of the ocean and sky did nothing to help."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tあんなにも海と空は美しいのに……。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_765E8C91_48F4_49B8_8547_EF0E80F51144
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d472f40fd01b1f67be019bee5adde356b5538b426695a70b426c078a2648d51e
#. default-sha256: 341aa0ddc666ebd81543e51dbfea84e9f2c040a3feb2b86eb6ee71854c992fb8
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_765E8C91_48F4_49B8_8547_EF0E80F51144"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In my mind, the beast was emblematic of the times—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫emaciated and enveloped in the "
"scent of blood."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tわたくし、⟪k:1⟫その獣が時代の象徴のように思えましたわ。⟪k:2⟫"
"⟪k:3⟫\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t血のにおいを纏う、⟪k:4⟫飢えた獣。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_B395005F_CE73_4906_BCB7_C1626238D28A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9125ecd71b32617f9dca4953c16b74bc53eb6d3073ca7c9de983d65b45b26bd2
#. default-sha256: 5d5c2082654927f96897e3214cf6d910186784f045583af53819a9f37e1b58bd
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B395005F_CE73_4906_BCB7_C1626238D28A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But the war came to an end. ⟪k:1⟫Thus the beast did not have to remain a beast, I thought."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫けれど戦は終わったのです。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ですから……、⟪k:3⟫そう、⟪k:4⟫獣が人になっても良いのではな"
"いでしょうか？"

#: scenario2:scenario2_EF4D48BD_1DEF_4547_9C87_2A8273C54029
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 554803dca2db984d235fa34d0d4783024facab3afefee1f1020ee8b48c69c283
#. default-sha256: 3fe367da84df908637a269a1e4122ce51acbce9cfe49b082cda1482ef58254f2
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_EF4D48BD_1DEF_4547_9C87_2A8273C54029"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Did he?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tねえ……？　"

#: scenario2:scenario2_B3B52B41_BC9E_441C_A36F_517C882497EB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 009a108dd97c4adb21bc56a26d7e90065ececa6f9fb7f5c3b4445d7e2d9bd0c0
#. default-sha256: bbd91f76ab47d8806854ad626e773b96e0cdd07c71489e402c5d83f2760fe9f4
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B3B52B41_BC9E_441C_A36F_517C882497EB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And so, I endeavored to make the beast more human-like."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫わたくしは獣を人らしくしようと試みました。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_36A1DD21_9EA4_4212_8CD9_A97D7F84D621
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 494fcabbd4e5030bbf01262f4ee649dbeef4de9ae0e15ad98e06394244b2bfb1
#. default-sha256: 9483c4be19c2665b215738eb95ec247bff8967ecbca5dff7b5ad392c7b86f858
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_36A1DD21_9EA4_4212_8CD9_A97D7F84D621"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫First, I needed to do something about his appearance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tまずは身形から整えなければなりません。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_FE16B9C9_16C1_4888_9F02_485BEF2C7FF1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 23206c7df0d6767ff639109c802426641f12bb861cfe8cf9843865a4ab20e51d
#. default-sha256: 4b81fd71055c92bfc312ae8f8f994c3070ff540f62b1d38c8b573baa51963fa9
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_FE16B9C9_16C1_4888_9F02_485BEF2C7FF1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I would draw a bath, scrub away all the filth, and dress him in clothing left in the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t湯を沸かし、⟪k:1⟫獣の汚れを取り除き、⟪k:2⟫それからお屋敷に残"
"されていたお洋服を着させて……。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_48B55AE9_720E_4D2B_ACE8_AE4BB780A80C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f7ca14e8f896685798e24fc32a9ed4cf2cb42fd4c8870c6f1dae1aa2c09b1196
#. default-sha256: 1f34e708075fed5b76941951991faaef569fa97e6dd5571f487d6fc16086a666
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_48B55AE9_720E_4D2B_ACE8_AE4BB780A80C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, having sat unused for fifty years, the majority of garments had been devoured by "
"insects and were of little use."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tけれど、⟪k:1⟫さすがに五十年も放置されたら、⟪k:2⟫衣服のほとん"
"どは虫に食われてしまって、⟪k:3⟫使いようがありませんでしたわ。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_D98AAD6D_E96B_4693_A747_C4715DFAB52D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b8e1c261eed70bc294c98c54314588b30b78d72a83ed4879bcd6a09d5b1784f7
#. default-sha256: 6bc21707d4c485095420a5c1b0d14a937d369764cc49ccaba3cdd0263e01835e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D98AAD6D_E96B_4693_A747_C4715DFAB52D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So I searched the mansion top to bottom for anything the beast could wear, heated up some "
"coals, and set to work ironing what I found."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t獣のためにまだ着られる衣服を探し出し、⟪k:1⟫火にかけた炭を用意"
"して、⟪k:2⟫必死にアイロンをかけました。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_A38703AC_3901_46C2_8B90_D4A6D91C8C6F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7056bc226e639799d3f1ce9a7819a3c2e04d745d6f46a56f44bf8fd83a52f6e2
#. default-sha256: 126c42b1567253654a4a79e8334af00b71050d31bb78b4242a7a5f1efdbc94f5
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A38703AC_3901_46C2_8B90_D4A6D91C8C6F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫At the time, steam irons had not yet been invented. We used plates of iron heated with coals."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tその当時は、⟪k:1⟫まだ、⟪k:2⟫スチーム式のアイロンもありません"
"でしたから、⟪k:3⟫炭で温めた鉄板がアイロンだったのです。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_D14A52B0_E3D7_45DA_AC8E_0606CC01932A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b3cada46916ad62c6e27f9b406db262fca893da46f58cac97356308f88b492b7
#. default-sha256: 88c6c54a07f571debacaa1f72c64094ce5c9d2827c79914e0c6ffda1c65b62e5
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D14A52B0_E3D7_45DA_AC8E_0606CC01932A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They somewhat resembled kettles."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t見た目は鍋に近かったでしょうか。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_C7E77E07_8625_4BD3_B4B1_D25477A405FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c24a3f2c7d6172400575a3c00efd647dd09faacb32d7f7bdde375e3bded7c22
#. default-sha256: 3893f42ced353a477a9ea8875cfab62c40d43fda1a81159229529a2f7a29eedd
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C7E77E07_8625_4BD3_B4B1_D25477A405FE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I even prepared meals for the beast, in order to teach him proper table "
"manners."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t食事の作法も覚えていただこうと、⟪k:4⟫わたく"
"し、⟪k:5⟫獣のためにお料理もしたんですのよ。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_07E03522_87A9_419B_9706_B7016EF22D0F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 41d38356b8bba0b63cbd89048a973bdc6178c58a948938e99c0fd25b7c365424
#. default-sha256: a58399e67374d6104088d682e78a2308107668bc6d6764ec1f15c83fcb598885
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_07E03522_87A9_419B_9706_B7016EF22D0F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Although, with the mansion in a nearly uninhabitable state of disarray, there was only so "
"much I could do in the kitchen."
msgstr ""
